<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Mineworkers raise cash for Rebhold shares.</title>
<headline>Mineworkers raise cash for Rebhold shares.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rebhold Ltd said on Thursday that the Mineworkers Investment Co Ltd has raised 92.7 million rand, an amount enabling it to subscribe in cash for Rebhold shares and accordingly fulfilling the suspensive conditions relating to such financing arrangements.</p>
<p>In view of this fulfilment, a cautionary dated May 14, 1997 has been withdrawn, Rebhold said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
